			// StaffOwnerTooltip: Bound player: {0}
			// StaffCompanionTooltip: Companion: {0} - {1}
			// StaffForeignTooltip: This weapon is bound to {0}; you cannot use it
			// StaffRebindHint: Right-click this item in the inventory to transfer its binding
			// StaffForeignUseBlocked: This weapon is bound to {0}; you cannot use it. Right-click it in the inventory to transfer its binding.
			// StaffRebound: Transfer complete: this is now your Phantom Staff #{0}; its companion is still {1}.
			// StaffTransferDataMissing: The staff has no safe companion snapshot to transfer, so its binding was not changed.
